Package: UTRunway
Type: Package
Title: Profile and Rank Candidate mRNA Construct Designs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Melody", "Mo", email = "melody.mo@mail.utoronto.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Melody Mo <melody.mo@mail.utoronto.cal>
Description: Profiles candidate messenger RNA constructs across the
    5' untranslated region, coding sequence, and 3' untranslated region,
    scoring the sequence features that drive translation initiation and
    transcript stability. Ranks candidate designs against one another and
    visualises the whole construct as a single annotated map.
